{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31428","headline":"送莫仲节状元归省 · 柳珪","name":"送莫仲节状元归省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青骢聚送谪仙人，南国荣亲不及君。\n椰子味从今日近，鹧鸪声向旧山闻。\n孤猨夜呌三湘月，匹马时侵五岭云。\n想到故乡应腊过，药栏犹有异花薰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳珪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}